/jibu/1230/34640.html，2026-10-16 访问；以识典古籍影印本《杜诗详注》卷七（清·仇兆鳌撰，四库全书本）与四部丛刊景宋刊本《分门集注杜工部诗》卷三对校。异文校记见 docs/sources/dream-li-bai-intake.md。" resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="dev.sopho.suofei" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[137,493][944,922]" /><node index="4" text="异文" resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="dev.sopho.suofei" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[137,989][214,1040]" /><node index="5" text="•" resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="dev.sopho.suofei" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[137,1061][153,1113]" /><node index="6" text="魂来枫叶青 —— 底本《全唐诗》作「枫叶」；《杜诗详注》卷七（影印四库全书本）、四部丛刊景宋刊本《分门集注杜工部诗》卷三、明刻本《杜工部集》正文均作「枫林」，《御定全唐诗》（影印四库全书本）于「叶」下出小注「一作林」。林、叶两读皆有古本可据，本仓从底本作「叶」。" resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="dev.sopho.suofei" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[174,1061][944,1755]" /><node index="7" text="•" resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="dev.sopho.suofei" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[137,1780][153,1832]" /><node index="8" text="「君今在罗网，何以有羽翼」二句的位置 —— 底本《全唐诗》与宋、明诸本此二句均在「魂返关塞黑」之后；《杜诗详注》卷七依黄生本移置「恐非平生魂」之前，并自记其改动：「君今二句，旧在关塞黑之下，今从黄生本移在此处，于两段语气方顺」。本仓从底本，不移置。" resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="dev.sopho.suofei" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[174,1780][944,2337]" /></node></node></node></node></node></node></node></node></node></hierarchy>